71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W2GUXOy80PQQ7kNvwG0_RDM&_nc_oc=Adpi2sN24SyxZ1jK3_QmLHKUSm-5xcKueON8_jLp4BwVVseeSAu46MnT3WiNZApmpd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCT0JWSFVksHAt-9bblG9HQi3HTCaK0nNHZ9rUEarR_3A&oe=6A54E3B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xbg41SJs7a4Q7kNvwEm8FLJ&_nc_oc=AdplpEkK18CcE9pla1tSYw9aWFcgoTLd81iB_kwmnG_mK--icYxXILcX5mkozblFKpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD7h_jhDOxm1PJGTtMg1fzl--XKQbitb0fAf2IVVlYZFw&oe=6A54F693"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5pnM7mL8CcMQ7kNvwGw1mmF&_nc_oc=AdrvqZbRaRym0Udqh7uISeYaojuMdb4S-6vuR6O82jlrAHhGM5OheVWTz1l3wVuTpaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDdwP_L4CV4yFpQTQTm7nUUpZTI_fv9qXrF91vD187Euw&oe=6A54F4DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: